<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AWS High Availability Demo | Server 01</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #2563eb;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card-bg: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.85);
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --border: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
    body {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1e293b, var(--bg));
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 30px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #22c55e; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    p.subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .box {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .box span { display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .box strong { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #fff; }
    .footer { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15); padding-top: 1.25rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="badge"><span class="dot"></span> Routed via Application Load Balancer</div>
    <h1>Multi-AZ Web Server 01</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Secure Tier: Deployed in Private Subnet</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="box">
        <span>Availability Zone</span>
        <strong style="color: var(--accent);">AZ-1 (us-east-1a)</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="box">
        <span>Tier Placement</span>
        <strong>Private Subnet</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="box">
        <span>Outbound Path</span>
        <strong>NAT Gateway 1</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="box">
        <span>Scaling Group</span>
        <strong>Active & Healthy</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">AWS Production Architecture Demo &bull; Refresh to test Load Balancing</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
